OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOvercast
OL,6,Fwith periods of occasionally heavy
OL,7,Frain through the evening, which turns
OL,8,Fpatchy and occasionally wintry to low
OL,9,Flevels overnight, as fresh to strong
OL,10,Fnortherly winds develop.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FPatchy rain, sleet and snow
OL,13,Finitially. Turning dry and bright
OL,14,Fduring morning. Showers developing
OL,15,Flater in day. Cold in brisk north to
OL,16,Fnorthwest winds, with temperatures
OL,17,Fwell down from Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
